    <div class="mn__g">
      <details class="mn__d mn__d--mega"><summary>For humans</summary><div class="mn__p mn__p--mega"><div class="mn__cols mn__cols--3"><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Check and fix</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i"><a href="/registry#join">Register your site</a><p>Free. Every agent that asks is told who runs it</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/for-sites#scanForm">Check my site</a><p>Free A–F report, every problem named</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/pricing#trial">Watch</a><p>Checked twice a day from $29 a month, with an alert when a check finds a regression</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/pricing#fix">Fix it</a><p>We do the fixes for $100 and prove them</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/executive-report">Executive report</a><p>A two-page PDF per site, monthly or weekly</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/how-it-works">How it works</a><p>The scan, step by step, and what each grade means</p></div></div></div><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Free tools</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i"><a href="/tools">All free tools</a><p>Every check, no account</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/tools/agent-lens">Agent lens</a><p>Your homepage as Chrome and as each AI crawler</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/robots-txt-for-ai-crawlers">robots.txt for AI crawlers</a><p>What each crawler is allowed, and what it got</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/llms-txt-audit">llms.txt audit</a><p>Read the way crawlers ask for it</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/listing-check">Listing check</a><p>Is your business record right where agents look?</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/compare">Compare two sites</a><p>Side by side, same measurement</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/tools/googlebot-check">Googlebot check</a><p>Is this IP from your logs really Google?</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/entity-map-validator">Entity map validator</a><p>entitymap.json against your structured data</p></div></div></div><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Fix it on your platform</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i mn__i--s"><a href="/fix/wordpress">WordPress</a></div><div class="mn__i mn__i--s"><a href="/fix/shopify">Shopify</a></div><div class="mn__i mn__i--s"><a href="/fix/wix">Wix</a></div><div class="mn__i mn__i--s"><a href="/fix/squarespace">Squarespace</a></div><div class="mn__i mn__i--s"><a href="/fix/webflow">Webflow</a></div><div class="mn__i mn__i--s"><a href="/fix/nextjs">Next.js</a></div><div class="mn__i mn__i--s"><a href="/fix/drupal">Drupal</a></div><div class="mn__i mn__i--s"><a href="/fix/cloudflare">Cloudflare</a></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/extension">Browser extension</a><p>Grades as you browse</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/app">The app</a><p>iPhone and Android</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mn__f"><p class="mn__fk">Register your site</p><p class="mn__fh">Prove who runs it.</p><p class="mn__ft">Registered sites answer every agent that asks: who runs this, what it declares, verified by a fetch. Free.</p><p class="mn__fa"><a class="btn" href="/registry#join">Register free</a></p></div></div></details>
      <a href="/datasets">Datasets</a>
      <details class="mn__d mn__d--mega"><summary>For agents</summary><div class="mn__p mn__p--mega"><div class="mn__cols mn__cols--3"><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Build</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i"><a href="/docs/quickstart">Quickstart</a><p>MCP, curl, Python, OpenAI Agents, LangChain, CrewAI, Vercel AI</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/docs/api">API reference</a><p>Every endpoint, with a worked example</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/sdk">SDKs</a><p>npm and PyPI, with the offline verifier</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/mcp/demo">MCP demo</a><p>An approved server allowed, a rewritten tool refused</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/docs/ci">CrawlCheck in CI</a><p>Fail a pull request that breaks crawler access</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/docs/policy-as-code">Policy as code</a><p>Preflight rules and tests in your repository</p></div></div></div><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Ask before acting</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i"><a href="/tools/agent-view">Agent view</a><p>The signed answer about any domain, for a person</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/spec/resolve">Resolve protocol</a><p>What the signed answer holds, how to verify it</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/registry/capabilities">Capability registry</a><p>What sites say agents may do, and what was verified</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/agents/conduct">Agent conduct</a><p>How each named agent behaves on sites</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/mcp/changes">MCP tool changes</a><p>Servers whose tools changed after approval</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/enterprise">Enterprise pilot</a><p>30 days of signed preflight for your agents</p></div></div></div><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Verify it yourself</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i"><a href="/verify">Verify a record</a><p>Check any answer on your own machine</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/keys">Signing keys</a><p>The Ed25519 keys every answer is signed with</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/rules">Rulebook</a><p>Every finding the measurement can raise</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/spec/canonical.json">Canonical numbers</a><p>The definition and every public count, with sources and as_of</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/conformance">Conformance</a><p>Run the suite against your own implementation</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/proof">Proof and timestamps</a><p>How every record is sealed and anchored</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/status">Service status</a><p>Scans, signing, seals and a signed incident log</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mn__f"><p class="mn__fk">Before you act</p><p class="mn__fh">One signed answer, no key.</p><p class="mn__ft">Read, cite, connect or transact: ask first, verify the receipt offline.</p><p class="mn__fa"><a class="btn" href="/docs/quickstart">Start in a minute</a></p></div></div></details>
      <details class="mn__d mn__d--mega"><summary>Research</summary><div class="mn__p mn__p--mega"><div class="mn__cols mn__cols--3"><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Live data</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i"><a href="/data#census">AI crawler census</a><p>The top 1,000 sites, read daily, open CC BY data</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/radar">AI crawler radar</a><p>What the top 10,000 sites say and serve</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/traffic-index">Agent Traffic Index</a><p>Verified and forged agent requests, monthly</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/metrics">Live figures</a><p>Decisions, scans and crawler visits, counted</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/benchmark">Agent safety benchmark</a><p>Do agents stop before acting?</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/globe">Scan globe</a><p>Every city a scan was started from</p></div></div></div><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Crawlers and vendors</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i"><a href="/ai-crawlers">AI crawlers</a><p>Who sends each agent and what it reads</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/ai-crawlers/compare">Crawlers compared</a><p>GPTBot vs ClaudeBot and more, two at a time</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/directory">SEO and AI tools, measured</a><p>The vendors that measure sites, measured by the same rules</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/registry">Registry</a><p>What registered sites declare, verified by a fetch</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/certificates">Certified sites</a><p>Every live machine-readability certificate</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/evidence">Evidence for disputes</a><p>A dated, signed record of what a site served</p></div></div></div><div class="mn__c"><p class="mn__h">Reports and method</p><div class="mn__l"><div class="mn__i"><a href="/editions">Editions</a><p>Four recurring reports, each signed with a feed</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/blog?kind=exclusive">Exclusive findings</a><p>Measured only here</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/research">How we read the data</a><p>The rules, what we never cite, how to report an error</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/learn/certified">Free course</a><p>Six lessons and a certificate</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/research/mcp-tool-changes">MCP tool changes</a><p>How often public MCP servers change the tools agents approved</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/research/best-ai-audit-tool-round-2">AI audit tools, Round 2</a><p>74 tools against 63 planted faults</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/research/best-ai-audit-tool">AI audit tools, tested</a><p>Twelve tools against ten planted faults</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/submit-finding">Submit a finding</a><p>Your study, published with credit</p></div><div class="mn__i"><a href="/corrections">Corrections</a><p>Everything we got wrong, dated</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mn__f"><p class="mn__fk">The census</p><p class="mn__fh">What the top sites serve AI crawlers.</p><p class="mn__ft">Read daily from our own network, open CC BY data, every figure with its denominator.</p><p class="mn__fa"><a class="btn" href="/data#census">Read the census</a></p></div></div></details>
